  "source": "[x \\.commutes.with:?in{M ::= (X, *)}./ y]\nStates:\nwhen:\n. M is \\magma\n. x, y \"in\" M\nthat: x * y = y * x\nDocumented:\n. called: \"$x?$ commutes with $y?$@[M]{ in $M?$}\"\n. description: \"Two elements $x$ and $y$ of a magma commute when $x * y = y *\n                x$. An operation in which every pair of elements commutes is\n                exactly a commutative one.\"\nId: \"3d7a204c-966d-47e7-a5b4-8f9e20fd749c\"",
